arg "[AgentBus: this conversation started before you joined it. Earlier turns ran on other agents. Below is each message the person sent and the final reply the agent gave, oldest first. Tool calls are left out. Any files those agents changed are in your current folder.]\n\n--- Turn 1, the person to Codex ---\none\n\n--- Turn 1, Codex replied ---\n(no reply: the turn ended without one)\n\n[AgentBus: end of the earlier turns. The person's new message to you follows.]\n\nnext t_2"
env "AGENTBUS_LAUNCH_DIR=<launch>"
env "AGENTBUS_TOKEN=<token>
env "AGENTBUS_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787"
env "HOME=<home>"
env "PATH=<data>/bin:/usr/bin:/bin"
env "PWD=<folder>"
cwd <folder>
